new file mode 100644
index 0000000..0eb42b9
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog/69890.added.md
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+Added support for a ``min`` usage threshold in the ``diskusage`` beacon, in addition to the existing ``max`` (previously the bare percentage value). This lets a mount alert when its usage unexpectedly drops below an expected level, which usually indicates the filesystem failed to mount rather than that space was freed up. Existing configuration using a bare percentage per mount continues to work unchanged and is equivalent to setting ``max``.
